# Django API origin (no trailing slash). Production build uses `.env.production`.
#
# `npm run dev`: leave empty (default in `.env.development`) so Vite proxies /api and /ws to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 — run `py manage.py runserver` in server/ first.
# To hit a remote API during dev instead, set e.g. VITE_API_BASE=https://api.shyam-sweets.com
# VITE_API_BASE=
VITE_API_BASE=

# Optional dev-only: bypass the API and set a Google Maps JS key directly. Production loads the key from
# GET /api/google-maps-js-key/ (Django fetches it from Infelo; see server infelo-api-map.md).
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
